    "final_answer": "I have successfully completed the task. Here is my final answer:\n\n## Search Results: Beginner-Level Digital Marketing Course on Coursera\n\nAfter applying the \"Beginner\" (初级) level filter to the \"Digital Marketing\" search on Coursera, the top-recommended course is:\n\n### 📚 Course Details\n\n**Course Title:** **Foundations of Digital Marketing and E-commerce**\n\n**Institution (Offered by):** **Google Career Certificates**\n\nThis course is part of the *Google Digital Marketing & E-commerce Professional Certificate* program.\n\n### ⏱️ Course Duration\n\n- **Total Duration:** Approximately **1 week** (at a recommended pace of **10 hours per week**)\n- 4 modules in total\n- Flexible schedule\n- No prior experience required\n\n### 🎯 Main Learning Outcomes\n\nBy the end of this course, learners will be able to:\n\n1. **Define** the fields of digital marketing and e-commerce\n2. **Describe** the job responsibilities of an entry-level digital marketer and e-commerce specialist\n3. **Explain** the concept of a marketing funnel\n4. **Understand** the elements and goals of a digital marketing and e-commerce strategy\n\n### 💼 Skills You Will Gain\n\n- Brand Awareness\n- Search Engine Marketing (SEM)\n- Performance Metrics\n- Branding\n- Marketing Analytics\n- Search Engine Optimization (SEO)\n- Digital Marketing\n- Digital Media Strategy\n- Data Storytelling\n\n### 📊 Course Statistics\n\n- **Rating:** 4.8/5 stars\n- **Reviews:** 31,950 reviews\n- **Enrolled:** 1,906,522 learners\n- **99%** of students say they liked the course\n- **17 assignments** (some AI-graded)\n- Available in **11 languages**\n- A **shareable certificate** is awarded upon completion, which can be added to LinkedIn",
